{"book":"hono","chapter":"guides","chapterTitle":"الأدلة","slug":"testing","title":"الاختبار","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"الطلب-والاستجابة","text":"الطلب والاستجابة"},{"depth":2,"id":"env","text":"Env"}],"html":"<p>الاختبار مهم.\nفي الواقع، من السهل اختبار تطبيقات Hono.\nتختلف طريقة إنشاء بيئة الاختبار من بيئة تشغيل إلى أخرى، لكن الخطوات الأساسية هي نفسها.\nفي هذا القسم، لنختبر باستخدام Cloudflare Workers و <a href=\"https://vitest.dev/\">Vitest</a>.</p>\n<p>توصي Cloudflare باستخدام <a href=\"https://vitest.dev/\">Vitest</a> مع <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers\">@cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers</a>. لمزيد من التفاصيل، يُرجى الرجوع إلى <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/vitest-integration/\">تكامل Vitest</a> في وثائق Cloudflare Workers.</p>\n<h2 id=\"الطلب-والاستجابة\">الطلب والاستجابة</h2>\n<p>كل ما عليك فعله هو إنشاء كائن Request وتمريره إلى تطبيق Hono للتحقق من Response. يمكنك بعد ذلك استخدام <code>app.request</code> الطريقة.</p>\n<p>للحصول على عميل اختبار مُنمّط (typed) انظر <a href=\"https://hono.dev/docs/helpers/testing\">مساعد الاختبار</a>.</p>\n<p>على سبيل المثال، فكر في تطبيق يوفر واجهة REST API التالية.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Many posts&#x27;</span>)\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(\n    {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">message</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Created&#x27;</span>,\n    },\n    <span class=\"hljs-number\">201</span>,\n    {\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Custom&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Thank you&#x27;</span>,\n    }\n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>أرسل طلبًا إلى <code>GET /posts</code> واختبر الاستجابة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">describe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Example&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">test</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET /posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">request</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">status</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">200</span>)\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>()).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Many posts&#x27;</span>)\n  })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>لإرسال طلب إلى <code>POST /posts</code>، قم بما يلي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">test</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST /posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">request</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">status</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">201</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Custom&#x27;</span>)).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Thank you&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>()).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toEqual</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">message</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Created&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>لإرسال طلب إلى <code>POST /posts</code> مع <code>JSON</code> البيانات، قم بما يلي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">test</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST /posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">request</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">body</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">stringify</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">message</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello hono&#x27;</span> }),\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">headers</span>: <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Headers</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Content-Type&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;application/json&#x27;</span> }),\n  })\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">status</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">201</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Custom&#x27;</span>)).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Thank you&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>()).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toEqual</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">message</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Created&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>لإرسال طلب إلى <code>POST /posts</code> مع <code>multipart/form-data</code> البيانات، قم بما يلي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">test</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST /posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> formData = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">FormData</span>()\n  formData.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">append</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;message&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">request</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">body</span>: formData,\n  })\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">status</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">201</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Custom&#x27;</span>)).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Thank you&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>()).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toEqual</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">message</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Created&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>يمكنك أيضًا تمرير نسخة من صنف Request.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">test</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST /posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> req = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Request</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;http://localhost/posts&#x27;</span>, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">request</span>(req)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">status</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">201</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Custom&#x27;</span>)).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toBe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Thank you&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">expect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>()).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toEqual</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">message</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Created&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>بهذه الطريقة، يمكنك اختباره كاختبار شامل (End-to-End).</p>\n<h2 id=\"env\">Env</h2>\n<p>لتعيين <code>c.env</code> للاختبار، يمكنك تمريره كمعامل ثالث إلى <code>app.request</code>. هذا مفيد لمحاكاة قيم مثل <a href=\"https://hono.dev/getting-started/cloudflare-workers#bindings\">Cloudflare Workers Bindings</a>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">MOCK_ENV</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">API_HOST</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;example.com&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">DB</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">prepare</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* mocked D1 */</span>\n    },\n  },\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">test</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET /posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">request</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, {}, <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">MOCK_ENV</span>)\n})\n</code></pre>\n"}